t. The doors very easily misalign if the cabinet is nudged in any way.\n\nAnonymous reviewer\nHelpful? (1)\n\n★☆☆☆☆　　11/14/2024\nSo disappointed. Wobbly junk.\n\nThe flimsy wood for the frame and plastic cam locks seriously degrade the quality of the overall product. The doors very easily misalign if the cabinet is nudged in any way.\n\nAnonymous reviewer\nHelpful? (1)"
